            "text": "<p><strong>Stage One: Advanced Carbon Filtration</strong><br/><br/>The activated carbon creates a highly complex structure that helps reduce contaminants such as Microplastics, Cysts, and Bacteria. Its powerful adsorptive properties also target chemicals including Chlorine, lead, and pesticides, delivering cleaner, safer water.</p><p><strong>Stage Two: Built-in Sterilisation</strong><br/><br/>Silver-infused technology helps inhibit the growth of bacteria and mould within the filter, supporting long-lasting purity and protection.</p><p></p>",
