    "custom_text_section_XRM4CG": {
      "type": "custom-text-section",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Custom Text",
      "settings": {
        "hd1": 32,
        "hd2": 24,
        "show_heading_line": true,
        "c1": false,
        "heading2": "",
        "heading": "How do KokoCarb Cartridges work?",
        "heading_color": "#1e1e1e",
        "line_color": "#ff7a00",
        "line_width_desktop": 550,
        "line_width_mobile": 330,
        "left_content": "<ul><li>Our Smart Carbon Cartridges rely on mechanical filtration method. The dense porous wall captures physical contaminants like microplastics, sediments, bacteria, cysts and other physical impurities.</li><li>By way of adsorption, chemical contaminants like chlorine, PFAS, pesticides, and many other chemical molecules get adhered to the surface of the activated carbon.</li><li>The activated carbon creates a highly complex structure that helps reduce contaminants such as Microplastics, Cysts, and Bacteria. Its powerful adsorptive properties also target chemicals including Chlorine, lead, and pesticides, delivering cleaner, safer water.</li></ul>",
        "t1": 18,
        "t2": 18,
        "text_width": 1200,
        "cl1": "#2f2954",
        "right_content": "<ul><li>Our activated coconut carbon cartridges filter water for all your drinking and cooking needs.</li><li>Designed for longevity- our cartridges last up to 12 months.<br/></li><li>This means fewer replacements and lower cost per litre.<br/></li><li>We use a touch of silver to prevent bacteria re-growth- one of the most common problems with traditional filters.</li><li>Silver-infused technology helps inhibit the growth of bacteria and mould within the filter, supporting long-lasting purity and protection.</li></ul>",
        "bottom_heading": "",
        "w1": 24,
        "w2": 16,
        "bottom_heading1": "",
