    "collapsible_content_jF6Q7J": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_GDBwCN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": " Is the KokoCarb the same as the Smart Carbon Cartridge?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The “KokoCarb” is a name upgrade and packaging upgrade to our carbon cartridges!</p><p>Introducing: <br/><strong>PrimeEasy </strong>- this clever widget simply connects your tap to the KokoCarb making priming quicker and easier than ever before; <br/><strong>At-Home Testing Kit </strong>- we’re including a simple at-home dye kit to test performance.  This can be used to check that the cartridges are both installed and are functioning correctly. </p><p>Our cartridges themselves remain the same - offering the same premium quality and filtration performance you can trust. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_BFTLe9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is The KokoCarb compatible with my existing Phoenix Gravity system?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. KokoCarb Cartridges are fully compatible and interchangeable with all systems that previously used the Smart Carbon Cartridge.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_D7di3E": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often should I replace the cartridges?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>For best performance, we recommend replacing your KokoCarb Cartridges every 12 months, depending on usage and water quality.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_W4xnAC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I clean my KokoCarb cartridges?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>If you notice a reduction in water flow, this may indicate that the cartridge is becoming blocked. In such instances, it can be gently cleaned at home using tap water and a soft brush or scourer.</p><p>Full cleaning instructions will be provided with your order and can also be found <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/1821/9557/files/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_Filter_2275b8c2-11e9-4233-80f2-5f84793d4bfb.pdf?v=1770968274\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/1821/9557/files/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_Filter_2275b8c2-11e9-4233-80f2-5f84793d4bfb.pdf?v=1770968274\">here</a>.</p><p>In most cases, your KokoCarb cartridges will not require cleaning. However, for consistently flawless performance we recommend replacing your KokoCarb Cartridges every 12 months.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tWhmT6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What contaminants do KokoCarb cartridges remove?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>KokoCarb cartridges are engineered to remove up to 99.99% of common contaminants, helping to ensure safer, better-tasting water.</p><p>These include:</p><ul><li>Chlorine and PFAS</li><li>Bacteria and Cysts</li><li>Insecticides and herbicides</li><li>Heavy metals such as lead, cadmium and mercury</li><li>Microplastics and much more</li></ul><p>For detailed performance data and reduction levels, please refer to <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/1821/9557/files/Phoenix_Gravity__Filtration_Performance__Contaminants_Lab_Reports_August_2024.pdf?v=1724753901\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Test Result\">our third party lab reports.</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_H8Qyp3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do KokoCarb cartridges remove fluoride?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>KokoCarb cartridges are not specifically designed for fluoride removal.</p><p>If you are looking to reduce fluoride in your drinking water, we recommend our specialised POSTreat Fluoride Removal Cartridge<strong> </strong>which works in conjunction with the KokoCarb.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UHMcUe": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges compatible with my gravity-fed system?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges are precision-engineered to work with nearly all gravity-fed water systems. They’re built for reliable performance and deliver clean, safe, great-tasting water every time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
